  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://blay09.net/files/brand/gravelminer.png\" alt=\"砂礫挖掘機\" width=\"600\" height=\"200\"></p>\n<p style=\"display:flex\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/balm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://mods.twelveiterations.com/img/requires-balm.png\" alt=\"需要 Balm\" width=\"260\" height=\"80\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmods.twelveiterations.com%252fsponsor\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"margin-left:26px\" src=\"https://mods.twelveiterations.com/img/new-patreon.png\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持\" width=\"550\" height=\"80\"></a></p>\n<p>本模組將消除大家常見的掉落砂礫問題，讓您的採礦體驗更加愉快。</p>\n<p>當您破壞方塊時，其上方所有正在下落的砂礫都會立即被破壞。</p>\n<p>本模組提供 NeoForge、Fabric 與 Forge 版本。它需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/balm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Balm</a>，且必須與本模組一同安裝。</p>\n<h3><img src=\"https://mods.twelveiterations.com/img/features-header.png\" alt=\"功能特色\" width=\"836\" height=\"40\"></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>破壞下方方塊時，立即破壞上方正在下落的砂礫</li>\n<li>客戶端為選配。僅有需求者需自行安裝。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/35/764/gravelminerserver.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"470\"></p>",
